 "texts": {
  "291fa7f53590": "The data supplied by the NHS IC to Wolfson Institute of Preventative Medicine will be used only for the approved Medical Research Project MR710.",
  "b9380582f9e9": "The aim of the study is to evaluate the reduction in incidence of, and mortality from, breast cancer associated with taking tamoxifen daily for 5 years.  The study will involve analysis of many endpoints to provide a risk-benefit assesment of this intervention."
 }
